First of all, I've had extensive conversations

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,120
with the Prime Minister of Israel

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,520
over the last several days, almost an hour each.

4
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:16,600
And I've made the case, and I feel very strongly about it,

5
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:21,400
that there has to be a temporary ceasefire

6
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:25,280
to get the prisoners out, to get the hostages out.

7
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:28,280
And that is underway.

8
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,520
I'm still hopeful that that can be done.

9
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:36,320
And in the meantime, I don't anticipate,

10
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:42,120
I'm hoping that the Israelis will not make

11
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:45,000
any massive land invasion in the meantime.

12
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:49,040
So it's my expectation that's not going to happen.

13
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:52,920
There has to be a ceasefire temporarily to get those hostages.

14
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:55,960
By the way, there are — we're in a situation

15
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,080
where there are American hostages.

16
