American citizens are being held hostage.

17
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:03,560
It's not just — not just Israelis.

18
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,200
It's American hostages as well.

19
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:10,040
And, you know, my hope and expectation

20
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,800
is that we'll get this hostage deal.

21
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,200
We'll bring the Americans home.

22
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,400
And the deal is being negotiated now.

23
